# research/ outputs, and the one tracked weight
#
# The evaluation tooling in research/ is source and is tracked. Its outputs
# are not. Order matters: last matching pattern wins, so the negation for
# the one weight that cannot be re-downloaded goes last. train.py re-fetches
# the yolov8n/s-seg base weights from Ultralytics on demand.
